---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="sec rev-sec" id="reviews">
  <div class="sec-wrap">
    <div class="rev-header">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">Reviews</div>
        <div class="h2">Verified — every one<br>of these people travelled.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rev-aggregate">
        <div style="text-align:center;padding-right:16px;border-right:1px solid var(--border)">
          <div class="rev-big-score">4.8</div>
          <div class="rev-stars-big">★★★★★</div>
          <div class="rev-count">312 trips</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rev-bar-wrap" style="padding-left:16px">
          <div class="rev-bar-row"><span>5★</span><div class="rev-bar-track"><div class="rev-bar-fill" style="width:82%"></div></div><span>82%</span></div>
          <div class="rev-bar-row"><span>4★</span><div class="rev-bar-track"><div class="rev-bar-fill" style="width:13%"></div></div><span>13%</span></div>
          <div class="rev-bar-row"><span>3★</span><div class="rev-bar-track"><div class="rev-bar-fill" style="width:4%;background:var(--border2)"></div></div><span>4%</span></div>
          <div class="rev-bar-row"><span>2★</span><div class="rev-bar-track"><div class="rev-bar-fill" style="width:1%;background:var(--border2)"></div></div><span>1%</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rev-grid">
      <div class="rev">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px">
          <div class="rev-stars">★★★★★</div>
          <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--t3)">August 2026</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rev-text">"Driver called 30 minutes before pickup, showed up bang on time. Aurangabad to Shirdi in a clean car with AC that actually worked the whole way. I've used four other cab services on this route. Axis is the only one that didn't make me anxious about whether they'd show up."</div>
        <div class="rev-sep"></div>
        <div class="rev-author">
          <div class="rev-ava ava1">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" width="44" height="44"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="22" fill="#DBEAFE"/><circle cx="22" cy="16" r="8" fill="#93C5FD"/><ellipse cx="22" cy="36" rx="13" ry="9" fill="#93C5FD"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="rev-name">Suresh Rane</div>
            <div class="rev-route"><Icon name="map-pin" size={14} /> Aurangabad → Shirdi · Sedan</div>
            <div class="rev-verified"><Icon name="badge-check" size={14} /> Verified trip</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rev">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px">
          <div class="rev-stars">★★★★★</div>
          <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--t3)">July 2026</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rev-text">"The AI itinerary planner is genuinely useful — not a gimmick. We typed 'Ajanta and Ellora from Pune, 2 adults, 1 day' and got a full plan on WhatsApp in under 3 minutes. Fare was exactly what they said. No additions at checkout. My husband was shocked. That literally never happens with cab bookings."</div>
        <div class="rev-sep"></div>
        <div class="rev-author">
          <div class="rev-ava ava2">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" width="44" height="44"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="22" fill="#DCFCE7"/><circle cx="22" cy="16" r="8" fill="#6EE7B7"/><ellipse cx="22" cy="36" rx="13" ry="9" fill="#6EE7B7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="rev-name">Priya Mehta</div>
            <div class="rev-route"><Icon name="map-pin" size={14} /> Pune → Ajanta &amp; Ellora · Innova</div>
            <div class="rev-verified"><Icon name="badge-check" size={14} /> Verified trip</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rev">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px">
          <div class="rev-stars">★★★★★</div>
          <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--t3)">Ongoing since April 2026</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rev-text">"We run three factory shifts in Chakan. Night pickups at 3:30am are non-negotiable. I've dealt with vendors who promise everything and deliver nothing at 4am. Axis has run our shifts for 5 months — zero missed pickups. One invoice at month end. The coordinator picks up on the first ring. That's it. That's the whole review."</div>
        <div class="rev-sep"></div>
        <div class="rev-author">
          <div class="rev-ava ava3">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" width="44" height="44"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="22" fill="#F3E8FF"/><circle cx="22" cy="16" r="8" fill="#C4B5FD"/><ellipse cx="22" cy="36" rx="13" ry="9" fill="#C4B5FD"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="rev-name">Amit Kulkarni</div>
            <div class="rev-route"><Icon name="map-pin" size={14} /> Corporate · Chakan plant, 65 employees</div>
            <div class="rev-verified"><Icon name="badge-check" size={14} /> Active contract</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
